abstract: >-
  Open-source Unity 2021.3 LTS project containing the Corsi Block Test in
  Virtual Reality (Corsi-VR) and the Deary-Liewald Reaction Time Task in
  Virtual Reality (DLRTT-VR). Supports 12 hardware-tailored scenes across PC VR
  (Varjo Aero / XR-3 / VR-3, HTC VIVE Pro Eye, Universal OpenXR PC) and
  Standalone Android VR (HTC VIVE Focus Vision with 120 Hz eye tracking and
  pupillometry, Meta Quest Pro with eye tracking, and Universal Standalone
  OpenXR), with Gaze Dwell (0.5 s), 6DoF Controller Ray-Casting, and Hand
  Tracking interactions.
